# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the sanitizer CI job (see "ASan and UBSan"
# in .github/workflows/all.yml). Only for leaks inside system libraries that
# Clementine can't free; fix leaks in Clementine's own code instead.

# libproxy, which Qt asks for the system's proxy before it connects a
# socket, keeps what it reads about the proxy configuration until exit.
leak:libpxbackend-1.0.so
leak:libproxy.so

# QtDBus keeps the bookkeeping for an object registered on a connection
# that has since been disconnected (portalglobalshortcutbackend_test
# registers its fake portal on a connection of its own for each test).
leak:QDBusConnection::registerObject
